C R202 OL GOV-001 | MUST | SPECIFICATION.md is the authoritative source for project-specific functional requirements and observable product behavior when it is non-empty. | product requirements | Empty template specification.
C R203 OL GOV-004 | REQUIRES_APPROVAL | If an omitted detail must be decided and materially affects observable product behavior, propose the smallest reasonable option and ask for approval; defining product behavior not defined by product sources is Reserved. | product ambiguity | none stated
C R204 OL GOV-009 | REQUIRES_APPROVAL | SPECIFICATION.md and CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md must not contradict each other; if they appear to conflict, stop and ask which source must be corrected. | product sources | none stated
C R205 OL GOV-010 | REQUIRES_APPROVAL | Do not silently invent a tunable value that materially changes accepted input or observable behavior when no product source defines it: propose it with its reason, get approval, record it and synchronize it. | tunable product values | none stated
C R206 OL GOV-011 | MUST NOT | Never store secrets, environment-specific connection details, package versions, HTTP status codes, ports, migration identifiers, incidental implementation constants or unoverridden framework defaults in CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md. | CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md | none stated
C R207 OL DEP-009 | DECIDED | Persistence stack: Entity Framework Core with Microsoft SQL Server through Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.SqlServer, used directly inside the adapter layer with provider concerns kept out of the use-case layer and core model. | persistence technology | none stated
C R208 OL DEP-008 | DECIDED | Backend platform: .NET 10 LTS (latest stable servicing release), C# 14, ASP.NET Core and ASP.NET Core Controllers; no move to a preview/RC .NET or C# release without approval. | backend platform | Approved preview move.
C R209 OL DEP-010 | DECIDED | FluentValidation is the standard library for explicit request and use-case validation; application logging uses ILogger<T> with Serilog (Serilog.AspNetCore) as the provider, adding sinks only when required. | validation and logging stack | none stated
C R210 OL DEP-013 | DECIDED | Backend test stack: NUnit with its test adapter; Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Testing with WebApplicationFactory<Program> as the integration-test baseline; Testcontainers is conditional and added only when isolated real-provider tests justify it. | backend testing stack | none stated
C R211 OL DEP-016 | DEFAULT | Playwright is the approved default when frontend E2E coverage is required; it is not part of the minimal baseline scaffold. | frontend E2E | none stated
C R212 OL DEP-011 | DEFAULT | Mapster (Mapster, Mapster.DependencyInjection) is added only when mapping volume becomes repetitive or non-trivial; manual mapping is fine for simple cases. | object mapping | none stated
